{"last_link_id": 585, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "int", "links": [366, 367], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int"}], "size": [315, 58], "pos": [-344.7834167480469, -1181.7115478515625], "widgets_values": [1024], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 242, "type": "Primitive integer [Crystools]", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Primitive integer [Crystools]"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "", "links": [], "type": "IMAGE"}], "size": [75, 26], "pos": [286.3773498535156, -51.36499786376953], "inputs": [{"name": "", "link": 513, "type": "*"}], "flags": {}, "id": 243, "type": "Reroute", "properties": {"horizontal": false, "showOutputText": false}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [310.6764221191406, 628.14013671875], "pos": [-342.54534912109375, -1053.0772705078125], "widgets_values": ["261e1e9ceb72c2ff586e561027c955673031b4cc13e1bb7ac7cc2778ca112dcd.jpg", "image", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "id": 197, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["\n## Flux Kontext 提示词技巧\n\n使用英文\n\n### 1.基础修改\n- 简单直接：'“将汽车颜色更改为红色”'\n- 保持风格：'“改为白天，同时保持画作的风格相同”'\n\n### 2.风格转换\n**原则：**\n- 明确命名风格：'“转变为包豪斯艺术风格”\n- 描述特征：'“转换为油画，笔触可见，颜料纹理厚重”'\n- 保留构图：'“在保持原始构图的同时更改为包豪斯风格”'\n\n### 3.角色一致性\n**框架：**\n- 具体描述：'“黑短发的女人”'而非'“她”'\n- 保留特征：'“同时保持相同的面部特征、发型和表情”'\n- 分步修改：先改背景，再改动作\n\n### 4.文本编辑\n- 使用引号：'“将 'joy' 替换为 'BFL'”'\n- 保持格式：'“在保持相同字体样式的同时替换文本”'\n\n## 常见问题解决\n\n### 角色变化过大\n❌ 错误：'“把人变成维京人”'\n✅ 正确：'“换衣服成为维京战士，同时保留面部特征”'\n\n### 构图位置改变\n❌ 错误：'“把他放在海滩上”'\n✅ 正确：'“将背景更改为海滩，同时保持人物处于完全相同的位置、比例和姿势”'\n\n### 风格应用不准确\n❌ 错误：'“使其成为草图”'\n✅ 正确：'“转换为具有自然石墨线条、交叉影线和可见纸张纹理的铅笔素描”'\n\n## 核心原则\n\n1. **具体明确** - 使用精确描述，避免模糊词汇\n2. **分步编辑** - 复杂修改分为多个简单步骤\n3. **明确保留** - 说明哪些要保持不变\n4. **动词选择** - 用\"更改\"、\"替换\"而非\"转换\"\n\n## 最佳实践模板\n\n**对象修改：**\n'“将 [对象] 更改为 [新状态]，保持 [要保留的内容] 不变”'\n\n**风格转换：**\n'“转换为 [特定风格]，同时保持 [构图/角色/其他] 不变”'\n\n**背景替换：**\n'“将背景更改为 [新背景]，保持主体处于完全相同的位置和姿势”'\n\n**文本编辑：**\n'“将'[原始文本]'替换为'[新文本]'，保持相同的字体样式”'\n\n> **记住：** 越具体越好，Kontext 擅长理解详细指令并保持一致性。."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Flux Kontext 提示词技巧", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [538.8888549804688, 1061.8717041015625], "pos": [-922.7240600585938, -1168.9893798828125], "id": 189, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [238], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [240, 26], "pos": [1469.575927734375, 387.29718017578125], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 237, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 135, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.39", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ConditioningZeroOut"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [57], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [240, 58], "pos": [1470.316162109375, 268.4169006347656], "widgets_values": [2.5], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 292, "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 35, "type": "FluxGuidance", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.38", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "FluxGuidance"}, "order": 29}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [292], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "size": [211.60000610351562, 46], "pos": [1205.616455078125, 270.62408447265625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 294, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditionin